# Build outputs
/deck*.pdf
/deck.pdfpc
/svg/
/site/
/result
/result-*

# Tooling
.direnv/
.DS_Store

# NOTE: everything else must stay *tracked*, not merely present. Nix flakes
# only see files git knows about, so a new .typ or image that you forget to
# `git add` fails the build with "Path ... is not tracked by Git" rather than
# being silently picked up from the working tree.
